#: admin/assets/js/admin.js:630
msgid "The check stopped: a step failed %d times in a row. Click “Check all links now” to start again."
msgstr "확인이 멈췄습니다: 한 단계가 %d번 연속 실패했습니다. “지금 모든 링크 확인”을 클릭해 다시 시작하세요."

#. translators: 1: links checked, 2: links to missing pages, 3: links that did not answer.
#: admin/assets/js/admin.js:638
